  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the Mains Admit Card for the recruitment of <strong>Probationary Officers</strong> on the official website. Online registration process for <strong>SBI PO Recruitment 2026</strong> were accepted from from <strong>18 June 2026, to 08 July 2026.</strong> There is a total of <strong>1,500 vacancies</strong> has been issued in the <strong>SBI PO Recruitment 2026</strong>. The mains examination is going to conducted on <strong>12 September 2026</strong>. Candidates who appeared for Pre examination can download their <strong>SBI PO Mains Admit Card 2026</strong> which has given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">State Bank of India (SBI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SBI PO Pre Mains Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>18 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>08 July 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>08 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Exam Training