strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their Mains Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also download their Mains Admit Card from official site of the SBI.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SBI PO Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Prelims Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Psychometric Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">GD / Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Sarkari Result on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a hre